              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GRAYCE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "No need to buy slices of ham. I had the Deli shave 1 lb. of ham. Then I chopped it up. Not a fan of djon so I used yellow mustard. Mixed all ingredients except mayo. Green onions were my choice using both white &amp; green, Then I added mayo slowly until I reached a nice mix to my liking.This goes really well on a good rye bread. I'm thinking of trying horseradish next time instead of mustard.",
            "datePublished": "2013-02-27T07:38:43.217Z"
          },
          {
