              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dina Verrilli"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is great for Easter leftovers! My modifications: Used more egg than ham, chopped up a dill pickle instead of using relish, used horseradish mustard, omitted the onion, added tarragon and celery seed. Yum!",
